flowchart TD
  Mutation[Row mutation] --> Tx[Transaction overlay]
  Tx --> Batch[write_batch / batch coordinator]
  Batch --> WAL[Frame WAL operation]
  WAL --> Sync[Immediate or group-commit durability boundary]
  Sync --> Mem[Apply to mutable memtable]
  Mem --> Immutable[Immutable memtable queue]
  Immutable --> Flush[Background flush]
  Flush --> Tmp[Write SSTable temporary file]
  Tmp --> Validate[Validate and atomically publish]
  Validate --> SST[SSTable read source]
  WAL --> Recover[Recovery source remains authoritative]
